{"book":"hono","chapter":"getting-started","chapterTitle":"مقدمات","slug":"service-worker","title":"`Service Worker`","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"1-الإعداد","text":"1. الإعداد"},{"depth":2,"id":"2-مرحبا-بالعالم","text":"2. مرحبًا بالعالم"},{"depth":3,"id":"استخدام-fire","text":"استخدام fire()"},{"depth":2,"id":"3-تشغيل","text":"3. تشغيل"}],"html":"<p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Service_Worker_API\"><code>Service Worker</code></a> هو برنامج نصي يعمل في خلفية المتصفح للتعامل مع مهام مثل التخزين المؤقت والإشعارات الفورية (push notifications). باستخدام محول Service Worker، يمكنك تشغيل تطبيقات مبنية بـ Hono كـ <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent\">FetchEvent</a> المعالج داخل المتصفح.</p>\n<p>توضّح هذه الصفحة مثالاً على إنشاء مشروع باستخدام <a href=\"https://vitejs.dev/\">Vite</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-الإعداد\">1. الإعداد</h2>\n<p>أولًا، أنشئ دليل مشروعك وانتقل إليه:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> my-app\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cd</span> my-app\n</code></pre>\n<p>أنشئ الملفات اللازمة للمشروع. أنشئ ملف <code>package.json</code> ملف كما يلي:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;name&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;my-app&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;private&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;scripts&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dev&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;vite dev&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;module&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>وبالمثل، أنشئ <code>tsconfig.json</code> ملف كما يلي:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;compilerOptions&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;target&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ES2020&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;module&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ESNext&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;lib&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ES2020&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;DOM&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;WebWorker&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;moduleResolution&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;bundler&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;include&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;./&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;exclude&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;node_modules&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>بعد ذلك، ثبّت الوحدات اللازمة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">npm i hono @hono/service-worker\nnpm i -D vite\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">yarn add hono @hono/service-worker\nyarn add -D vite\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">pnpm add hono @hono/service-worker\npnpm add -D vite\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">bun add hono @hono/service-worker\nbun add -D vite\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"2-مرحبا-بالعالم\">2. مرحبًا بالعالم</h2>\n<p>تعديل <code>index.html</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;!doctype <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/sw&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Hello World by Service Worker<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;module&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/main.ts&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n\n</code></pre>\n<p><code>main.ts</code> سكربت لتسجيل Service Worker:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">register</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  navigator.<span class=\"hljs-property\">serviceWorker</span>\n    .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">register</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/sw.ts&#x27;</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scope</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/sw&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;module&#x27;</span> })\n    .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> (<span class=\"hljs-params\">_registration</span>) {\n        <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Register Service Worker: Success&#x27;</span>)\n      },\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> (<span class=\"hljs-params\">_error</span>) {\n        <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Register Service Worker: Error&#x27;</span>)\n      }\n    )\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">start</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  navigator.<span class=\"hljs-property\">serviceWorker</span>\n    .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getRegistrations</span>()\n    .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> (<span class=\"hljs-params\">registrations</span>) {\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> registration <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">of</span> registrations) {\n        <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Unregister Service Worker&#x27;</span>)\n        registration.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">unregister</span>()\n      }\n      <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">register</span>()\n    })\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">start</span>()\n</code></pre>\n<p>في <code>sw.ts</code>، أنشئ تطبيقاً باستخدام Hono وسجِّله في <code>fetch</code> الحدث باستخدام محوّل Service Worker <code>handle</code> دالة. وهذا يسمح لتطبيق Hono باعتراض الوصول إلى <code>/sw</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// To support types</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/14877</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">declare</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">self</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ServiceWorkerGlobalScope</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { handle } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@hono/service-worker&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">basePath</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/sw&#x27;</span>)\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hello World&#x27;</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;fetch&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">handle</span>(app))\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"استخدام-fire\">استخدام <code>fire()</code></h3>\n<p>الـ <code>fire()</code> الدالة تستدعي تلقائيًا <code>addEventListener('fetch', handle(app))</code> نيابةً عنك، مما يجعل الكود أكثر إيجازًا.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { fire } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@hono/service-worker&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">basePath</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/sw&#x27;</span>)\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hello World&#x27;</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fire</span>(app)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"3-تشغيل\">3. تشغيل</h2>\n<p>شغّل خادم التطوير.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">npm run dev\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">yarn dev\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">pnpm run dev\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">bun run dev\n</code></pre>\n<p>افتراضيًا، سيعمل خادم التطوير على المنفذ <code>5173</code>. الوصول <code>http://localhost:5173/</code> في متصفحك لإكمال تسجيل عامل الخدمة (Service Worker). ثم، قم بالوصول إلى <code>/sw</code> لرؤية الاستجابة من تطبيق Hono.</p>\n"}